            tem when it decoded the results of an RPC call.  The _o_u_t argument
            is the address of the results, and _o_u_t_p_r_o_c is the XDR routine de‐
            scribing the results.  This routine returns 1 if the results were
            successfully freed, and 0 otherwise.

